  rcases hcases with h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h
